        "text": "The file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tscircuit_operation_manual.md has been edited. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tscircuit_operation_manual.md:\n   263\t| [`<breakout />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/breakout.md) | A container used to guide the autorouter on where connections should exit a group. |\n   264\t| [`<breakoutpoint />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/breakoutpoint.md) | Marks the XY coordinate that the autorouter should use when connecting a net or pin inside a breakout. |\n   265\t| [`<cadassembly />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/cadassembly.md) | Used to put together the 3D models of a component when multiple models are used. |\n   266\t| [`<cadmodel />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/cadmodel.md) | Used to display a 3D model of a component. |\n   267\t| [`<capacitor />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/capacitor.md) | Stores electrical energy in an electric field, used for filtering, energy storage, and timing. |\n   268\t\n   269\tPlease refer to the individual markdown files for more details on each component.\n   270\t\n   271\t\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary.",
