      {
        "cache_prompt": false,
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tsci_built_in_elements/cadassembly.md:\n     1\t# <cadassembly />\n     2\t\n     3\tA CAD assembly is used to put together the 3D models of a component when multiple models are used or \"fit into\" models in a particular way.\n     4\t\n     5\t```\n     6\texport default () => (  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">    <chip      name=\"J1\"      cadModel={        <cadassembly>          <cadmodel            positionOffset={{ x: 0, y: -4, z: 0 }}            rotationOffset={{ x: 0, y: 0, z: 0 }}            modelUrl=\"https://modelcdn.tscircuit.com/jscad_models/pinrow4.glb\"          />          <cadmodel            positionOffset={{ x: 0, y: 4, z: 0 }}            rotationOffset={{ x: 0, y: 0, z: 0 }}            modelUrl=\"https://modelcdn.tscircuit.com/jscad_models/pinrow4.glb\"          />        </cadassembly>      }    />  </board>)\n     7\t```\n     8\t\n     9\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA81SwWoDIRC95ysGTwmkawI5Let%2BQKH01HNx1Y0WXUUnJOmSf69rtrSF9JRLPIjv%2BZ7jY0adgo8IUvX8YBGWK2AtLBcATed5lHA0EjUj241zBLQye40zarMoy4Q2oZwABu4UI89bMmPB5YuXyrJxJiY5lzwl5Tp7vj7ww7tJ%2B4sDCD4ZNH547fukkI0jnGrYrOFcw9NuDZ8ZwOXyxxI98n8seb%2FlKGXfomVEI4ZUU1oYIYcKkzBRHAxWwjv6kfIn38tlosEM0R931d5233GnRe8K9fCZGnqjf9fSRdXQMjXtYvUFapE5ClgCAAA%3D)![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA81SwWoDIRC95ysGTwmkawI5Let%2BQKH01HNx1Y0WXUUnJOmSf69rtrSF9JRLPIjv%2BZ7jY0adgo8IUvX8YBGWK2AtLBcATed5lHA0EjUj241zBLQye40zarMoy4Q2oZwABu4UI89bMmPB5YuXyrJxJiY5lzwl5Tp7vj7ww7tJ%2B4sDCD4ZNH547fukkI0jnGrYrOFcw9NuDZ8ZwOXyxxI98n8seb%2FlKGXfomVEI4ZUU1oYIYcKkzBRHAxWwjv6kfIn38tlosEM0R931d5233GnRe8K9fCZGnqjf9fSRdXQMjXtYvUFapE5ClgCAAA%3D&simulation_experiment_id=simulation_experiment_0)![Pinout Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pinout&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA81SwWoDIRC95ysGTwmkawI5Let%