    "role": "tool",
    "content": [
      {
        "cache_prompt": false,
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tsci_built_in_elements/hole.md:\n     1\t# <hole />\n     2\t\n     3\t## Overview\n     4\t\n     5\tA `<hole />` is used for mechanical mounting and **does not have any conductive properties**.\n     6\tFor a hole with a conductive copper ring, see [`<platedhole />`](/footprints/platedhole).\n     7\t\n     8\t* Holes **do not appear in the schematic**\n     9\t* Holes can be used:\n    10\t\n    11\t  * Inside a [`<footprint />`](/elements/footprint)\n    12\t  * As a standalone PCB element\n    13\t\n    14\t---\n    15\t\n    16\t## Hole Shapes\n    17\t\n    18\tTwo hole shapes are supported:\n    19\t\n    20\t* **`circle`** \u2014 A circular hole (default)\n    21\t* **`pill`** \u2014 A pill-shaped (rounded rectangle) hole\n    22\t\n    23\t---\n    24\t\n    25\t## Circle Hole\n    26\t\n    27\tA circular hole is the most common type used for mounting.\n    28\t\n    29\t### Example\n    30\t\n    31\t```tsx\n    32\texport default () => (\n    33\t  <board width=\"30mm\" height=\"20mm\">\n    34\t    <hole diameter=\"3mm\" pcbX={0} pcbY={0} />\n    35\t  </board>\n    36\t)\n    37\t```\n    38\t\n    39\t### Previews\n    40\t\n    41\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAx3MQQqAIBSE4X2nGFzVqqhteo5aWr5SSAx5URDdPXX3D3wMPWeIDEObvg5G3UAq1BUwLkFHg9sZtlIMnfcCltxuWYo%2BL5VQYjYcBOO0J6aYYHbnukzy7b4cc4k267Etn6pqfvS1p6l2AAAA)\n    42\t![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAx3MQQqAIBSE4X2nGFzVqqhteo5aWr5SSAx5URDdPXX3D3wMPWeIDEObvg5G3UAq1BUwLkFHg9sZtlIMnfcCltxuWYo%2BL5VQYjYcBOO0J6aYYHbnukzy7b4cc4k267Etn6pqfvS1p6l2AAAA\\&simulation_experiment_id=simulation_experiment_0)\n    43\t![Pinout Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pinout\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAx3MQQqAIBSE4X2nGFzVqqhteo5aWr5SSAx5URDdPXX3D3wMPWeIDEObvg5G3UAq1BUwLkFHg9sZtlIMnfcCltxuWYo%2BL5VQYjYcBOO0J6aYYHbnukzy7b4cc4k267Etn6pqfvS1p6l2AAAA)\n    44\t![3D Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=3d\\&format=png\\&png_width=800\\&png_height=600\\&show_infinite_grid=true\\&background_color=%23ffffff\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAx3MQQqAIBSE4X2nGFzVqqhteo5aWr5SSAx5URDdPXX3D3wMPWeIDEObvg5G3UAq1BUwLkFHg9sZtlIMnfcCltxuWYo%2BL5VQYjYcBOO0J6aYYHbnukzy7b4cc4k267Etn6pqfvS1p6l2AAAA)\n    45\t\n    46\t---\n    47\t\n    48\t## Pill-Shaped Hole\n    49\t\n    50\tPill-shaped holes are useful when elongated mounting slots or positional adjustment is required.\n    51\t\n    52\t### Example\n    53\t\n    54\t```tsx\n    55\texport default () => (\n    56\t  <board width=\"30mm\" height=\"20mm\">\n    57\t    <hole\n    58\t      shape=\"pill\"\n    59\t      width=\"5mm\"\n    60\t      height=\"2mm\"\n    61\t      pcbX={0}\n    62\t      pcbY={0}\n    63\t    />\n    64\t  </board>\n    65\t)\n    66\t```\n    67\t\n    68\t### Previews\n    69\t\n    70\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA0utKMgvKlFISU1LLM0pUdDQVLC1U9DgUlCwScpPLEpRKM9MKcmwVTI2yM1VUshIzUzPKLFVMgLx7ICKgMoy8nNSFcBMBYXijMSCVFulgsycHCWYGNQAU5B%2BqBDcGCSxguSkCNtqg1okfiSCrw%2ByzEYf7CQ7Lk0Aqd10a7UAAAA%3D)\n    71\t![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA0utKMgvKlFISU1LLM0pUdDQVLC1U9DgUlCwScpPLEpRKM9MKcmwVTI2yM1VUshIzUzPKLFVMgLx7ICKgMoy8nNSFcBMBYXijMSCVFulgsycHCWYGNQAU5B%2BqBDcGCSxguSkCNtqg1okfiSCrw%2ByzEYf7CQ7Lk0Aqd10a7UAAAA%3D\\&simulation_experiment_id=simulation_experiment_0)\n    72\t![Pinout Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pinout\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA0utKMgvKlFISU1LLM0pUdDQVLC1U9DgUlCwScpPLEpRKM9MKcmwVTI2yM1VUshIzUzPKLFVMgLx7ICKgMoy8nNSFcBMBYXijMSCVFulgsycHCWYGNQAU5B%2BqBDcGCSxguSkCNtqg1okfiSCrw%2ByzEYf7CQ7Lk0Aqd10a7UAAAA%3D)\n    73\t![3D Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=3d\\&format=png\\&png_width=800\\&png_height=600\\&show_infinite_grid=true\\&background_color=%23ffffff\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA0utKMgvKlFISU1LLM0pUdDQVLC1U9DgUlCwScpPLEpRKM9MKcmwVTI2yM1VUshIzUzPKLFVMgLx7ICKgMoy8nNSFcBMBYXijMSCVFulgsycHCWYGNQAU5B%2BqBDcGCSxguSkCNtqg1okfiSCrw%2ByzEYf7CQ7Lk0Aqd10a7UAAAA%3D)\n    74\t\n    75\t---\n    76\t\n    77\t## Rotated Pill Hole\n    78\t\n    79\tPill-shaped holes can be rotated using the `pcbRotation` property.\n    80\t\n    81\t### Example\n    82\t\n    83\t```tsx\n    84\texport default () => (\n    85\t  <board width=\"30mm\" height=\"20mm\">\n    86\t    <hole\n    87\t      shape=\"pill\"\n    88\t      width=\"5mm\"\n    89\t      height=\"2mm\"\n    90\t      pcbX={0}\n    91\t      pcbY={0}\n    92\t      pcbRotation=\"45deg\"\n    93\t    />\n    94\t  </board>\n    95\t)\n    96\t```\n    97\t\n    98\t### Previews\n    99\t\n   100\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA02OwQ6CMBBE73zFZk9wgqjc2H6EJz0Wu9ImxTa4RhPjv0sbFG77Zmcmw68YJgHDV%2F3wAmUFpKAsALo%2B6MnA0xmxhPtmHBEsu8EK4S6Rmk2zzQbPkE%2BAu9WRCaPzHn%2FaUtCm%2FCL9azZavPQnejefDZ8Tr3gMosWFG%2BGhNTxg%2FtRpRVfnraqovnhr3lrOAAAA)\n   101\t![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA02OwQ6CMBBE73zFZk9wgqjc2H6EJz0Wu9ImxTa4RhPjv0sbFG77Zmcmw68YJgHDV%2F3wAmUFpKAsALo%2B6MnA0xmxhPtmHBEsu8EK4S6Rmk2zzQbPkE%2BAu9WRCaPzHn%2FaUtCm%2FCL9azZavPQnejefDZ8Tr3gMosWFG%2BGhNTxg%2FtRpRVfnraqovnhr3lrOAAAA\\&simulation_experiment_id=simulation_experiment_0)\n   102\t![Pinout Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pinout\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA02OwQ6CMBBE73zFZk9wgqjc2H6EJz0Wu9ImxTa4RhPjv0sbFG77Zmcmw68YJgHDV%2F3wAmUFpKAsALo%2B6MnA0xmxhPtmHBEsu8EK4S6Rmk2zzQbPkE%2BAu9WRCaPzHn%2FaUtCm%2FCL9azZavPQnejefDZ8Tr3gMosWFG%2BGhNTxg%2FtRpRVfnraqovnhr3lrOAAAA)\n   103\t![3D Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=3d\\&format=png\\&png_width=800\\&png_height=600\\&show_infinite_grid=true\\&background_color=%23ffffff\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA02OwQ6CMBBE73zFZk9wgqjc2H6EJz0Wu9ImxTa4RhPjv0sbFG77Zmcmw68YJgHDV%2F3wAmUFpKAsALo%2B6MnA0xmxhPtmHBEsu8EK4S6Rmk2zzQbPkE%2BAu9WRCaPzHn%2FaUtCm%2FCL9azZavPQnejefDZ8Tr3gMosWFG%2BGhNTxg%2FtRpRVfnraqovnhr3lrOAAAA)\n   104\t\n   105\t---\n   106\t\n   107\t## Properties\n   108\t\n   109\t| Property      | Applies To | Type                  | Default    | Description                              |\n   110\t| ------------- | ---------- | --------------------- | ---------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n   111\t| `shape`       | all        | `\"circle\"` | `\"pill\"` | `\"circle\"` | Shape of the hole                        |\n   112\t| `diameter`    | circle     | `number \\| string`    | \u2014          | Diameter of the circular hole            |\n   113\t| `width`       | pill       | `number \\| string`    | \u2014          | Width of the pill-shaped hole            |\n   114\t| `height`      | pill       | `number \\| string`    | \u2014          | Height of the pill-shaped hole           |\n   115\t| `pcbX`        | all        | `number`              | `0`        | X position of the hole center on the PCB |\n   116\t| `pcbY`        | all        | `number`              | `0`        | Y position of the hole center on the PCB |\n   117\t| `pcbRotation` | pill       | `number \\| string`    | `0`        | Rotation angle (e.g. `\"45deg\"` or `45`)  |\n   118\t\n   119\t\n",
        "enable_truncation": true
      }
    ],
