        "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tsci_built_in_elements/footprint.md:\n     1\t# <footprint />\n     2\t\n     3\t## Overview[\u200b](#overview \"Direct link to Overview\")\n     4\t\n     5\tWithin a `<footprint />` element you can define PCB elements such as [`<platedhole />`](/footprints/platedhole) or [`<smtpad />`](/footprints/smtpad).\n     6\t\n     7\tHere's an example of a chip with a custom footprint:\n     8\t\n     9\t```\n    10\texport default () => (<board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">  <chip    name=\"U1\"    footprint={      <footprint>        <platedhole          portHints={[\"4\"]}          pcbX=\"3.2499299999998357mm\"          pcbY=\"-2.249932000000058mm\"          outerDiameter=\"1.9999959999999999mm\"          holeDiameter=\"1.3000228mm\"          shape=\"circle\"        />        <platedhole          portHints={[\"2\"]}          pcbX=\"3.2499299999998357mm\"          pcbY=\"2.249932000000058mm\"          outerDiameter=\"1.9999959999999999mm\"          holeDiameter=\"1.3000228mm\"          shape=\"circle\"        />        <platedhole          portHints={[\"1\"]}          pcbX=\"-3.2499299999999494mm\"          pcbY=\"2.249932000000058mm\"          outerDiameter=\"1.9999959999999999mm\"          holeDiameter=\"1.3000228mm\"          shape=\"circle\"        />        <platedhole          portHints={[\"3\"]}          pcbX=\"-3.2499299999999494mm\"          pcbY=\"-2.249932000000058mm\"          outerDiameter=\"1.9999959999999999mm\"          holeDiameter=\"1.3000228mm\"          shape=\"circle\"        />        <silkscreenpath          route={[            { x: -2.2743160000001126, y: -2.999994000000015 },            { x: 2.274315999999999, y: -2.999994000000015 },          ]}        />        <silkscreenpath          route={[            { x: -2.999994000000129, y: 1.0999978000000965 },            { x: -2.999994000000129, y: -0.999998000000005 },          ]}        />        <silkscreenpath          route={[            { x: 3.0999937999998792, y: 1.0279888000000028 },            { x: 3.0999937999998792, y: -1.0999977999999828 },          ]}        />        <silkscreenpath          route={[            { x: -1.99999600000001, y: 2.999994000000015 },            { x: 2.274315999999999, y: 2.999994000000015 },          ]}        />      </footprint>    }    schPortArrangement={{      leftSide: {        direction: \"top-to-bottom\",        pins: [1, 3],      },      rightSide: {        direction: \"bottom-to-top\",        pins: [4, 2],      },    }}  /></board>)\n    11\t```\n    12\t\n    13\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA91WQWvbMBi951d86NRCnFiSE1shDgx22HEwBhulB8dWajHbMrLKOkL%2B%2ByTLTpw0HVuzQltdjJ6%2B9%2FSe%2FBmZP9RSacj4JrkvNFxdQ7yCq9FyLROVwU%2BR6TxG2C9LBDkXd7nuZqsRwDLNRW2eAFVS8hh9xaidbaTUtRKVjrft3FTuIcvrsLpINM9yWfA9BmDdfDJ1Tby9QQG63Q3X0vW3GNEJCRgjzI2IzkJj57jqe4w80pZR4rsxi46r5L3m6qMwvs3TZJq0arNO1YzjcutyWE2NJCEnmk2e1OYYUqHSgh8Wpv%2BUmTw%2F81uNjM9F9o4zs4AF7ykzvSDzK%2B3tRhQ%2FmlRxXtWJzgdcZQ2Z0AMIYAsPC7BJwoDiuQuCMZmP4VeLuwPoEuIZ7MaP6R37kOyvyIODv9z%2BcCdMnAE88S0aRg5m8%2FPun2B7voM7tnm9L2WfOp80dPuFjPT2SciiqDdAorP2n2B7fXqHs%2BiU%2Fh%2BPv%2Bvsrnt83Bq4pHWe0TnL6cnd5mqaNP9svvcPSiXVHS%2B5vQz727DgG%2F1FZHwBPQKQCcVTLWS1AKRl7WnpraXWskQHA7WomgXcmJj0tkf3%2FpS9nP%2Bk6uSssNF%2FrBqMgZyq7mwWk3Q5bX8HVqPr30vVu5MvCAAA)![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA91WQWvbMBi951d86NRCnFiSE1shDgx22HEwBhulB8dWajHbMrLKOkL%2B%2ByTLTpw0HVuzQltdjJ6%2B9%2FSe%2FBmZP9RSacj4JrkvNFxdQ7yCq9FyLROVwU%2BR6TxG2C9LBDkXd7nuZqsRwDLNRW2eAFVS8hh9xaidbaTUtRKVjrft3FTuIcvrsLpINM9yWfA9BmDdfDJ1Tby9QQG63Q3X0vW3GNEJCRgjzI2IzkJj57jqe4w80pZR4rsxi46r5L3m6qMwvs3TZJq0arNO1YzjcutyWE2NJCEnmk2e1OYYUqHSgh8Wpv%2BUmTw%2F81uNjM9F9o4zs4AF7ykzvSDzK%2B3tRhQ%2FmlRxXtWJzgdcZQ2Z0AMIYAsPC7BJwoDiuQuCMZmP4VeLuwPoEuIZ7MaP6R37kOyvyIODv9z%2BcCdMnAE88S0aRg5m8%2FPun2B7voM7tnm9L2WfOp80dPuFjPT2Scii