    "role": "tool",
    "content": [
      {
        "cache_prompt": false,
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tsci_built_in_elements/group.md:\n     1\t# <group />\n     2\t\n     3\tA `<group />` is the basic container element that can contain other elements.\n     4\t\n     5\tBy default, a group does **not** affect the circuit electrically or physically\u2014it only serves as a structural and layout container.\n     6\t\n     7\t---\n     8\t\n     9\t## Basic Example\n    10\t\n    11\t```tsx\n    12\timport { sel } from \"tscircuit\"\n    13\t\n    14\texport default () => (\n    15\t  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    16\t    <resistor name=\"R1\" resistance=\"1k\" schX={-2} />\n    17\t\n    18\t    <group schY={-3}>\n    19\t      <resistor name=\"R2\" resistance=\"1k\" schX={2} />\n    20\t      <trace from={sel.R1.pin2} to={sel.R2.pin1} />\n    21\t    </group>\n    22\t  </board>\n    23\t)\n    24\t```\n    25\t\n    26\t### Previews\n    27\t\n    28\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA3WPwQ6DIBBE737FhpMeqsVexY%2Fw1B4popCKGFjTJsZ%2FL6KJl%2FY4LzOzO9pM1iEs4OUAK3TOGiDohXZi1kiSRH6ioZUdnweENANWQ5oAVE%2FLXQtv3aJihF6NIaCk7hUeqg6mYHPSa4%2FWwciNZKShBHbERxE0fRHwQt3ZcilXKI5Q7%2Bw8bfwR%2BG3d6Y%2By8l%2FZ2RVS6LiQcRtbws68ofmkx2BBe4ByA%2FS8X8QHNlEVcWedZF%2Boa4XxKwEAAA%3D%3D)\n    29\t\n    30\t![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA3WPwQ6DIBBE737FhpMeqsVexY%2Fw1B4popCKGFjTJsZ%2FL6KJl%2FY4LzOzO9pM1iEs4OUAK3TOGiDohXZi1kiSRH6ioZUdnweENANWQ5oAVE%2FLXQtv3aJihF6NIaCk7hUeqg6mYHPSa4%2FWwciNZKShBHbERxE0fRHwQt3ZcilXKI5Q7%2Bw8bfwR%2BG3d6Y%2By8l%2FZ2RVS6LiQcRtbws68ofmkx2BBe4ByA%2FS8X8QHNlEVcWedZF%2Boa4XxKwEAAA%3D%3D\\&simulation_experiment_id=simulation_experiment_0)\n    31\t\n    32\t![Pinout Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pinout\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA3WPwQ6DIBBE737FhpMeqsVexY%2Fw1B4popCKGFjTJsZ%2FL6KJl%2FY4LzOzO9pM1iEs4OUAK3TOGiDohXZi1kiSRH6ioZUdnweENANWQ5oAVE%2FLXQtv3aJihF6NIaCk7hUeqg6mYHPSa4%2FWwciNZKShBHbERxE0fRHwQt3ZcilXKI5Q7%2Bw8bfwR%2BG3d6Y%2By8l%2FZ2RVS6LiQcRtbws68ofmkx2BBe4ByA%2FS8X8QHNlEVcWedZF%2Boa4XxKwEAAA%3D%3D)\n    33\t\n    34\t![3D Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=3d\\&format=png\\&png_width=800\\&png_height=600\\&show_infinite_grid=true\\&background_color=%23ffffff\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAA3WPwQ6DIBBE737FhpMeqsVexY%2Fw1B4popCKGFjTJsZ%2FL6KJl%2FY4LzOzO9pM1iEs4OUAK3TOGiDohXZi1kiSRH6ioZUdnweENANWQ5oAVE%2FLXQtv3aJihF6NIaCk7hUeqg6mYHPSa4%2FWwciNZKShBHbERxE0fRHwQt3ZcilXKI5Q7%2Bw8bfwR%2BG3d6Y%2By8l%2FZ2RVS6LiQcRtbws68ofmkx2BBe4ByA%2FS8X8QHNlEVcWedZF%2Boa4XxKwEAAA%3D%3D)\n    35\t\n    36\t---\n    37\t\n    38\t## Props\n    39\t\n    40\t### Core Props\n    41\t\n    42\t| Prop                      | Type                                         | Description                                                 |\n    43\t| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n    44\t| `name`                    | `string`                                     | Optional identifier for the group element                   |\n    45\t| `children`                | `any`                                        | Elements rendered inside the group                          |\n    46\t| `schTitle`                | `string`                                     | Title displayed above the group in schematic view           |\n    47\t| `showAsSchematicBox`      | `boolean`                                    | Render the group as a single schematic box                  |\n    48\t| `connections`             | `Connections`                                | Maps external pin names to internal targets                 |\n    49\t| `schPinArrangement`       | `SchematicPinArrangement`                    | Controls pin order and side placement in schematic box mode |\n    50\t| `schPinSpacing`           | `Distance`                                   | Spacing between schematic pins                              |\n    51\t| `schPinStyle`             | `SchematicPinStyle`                          | Style overrides for individual schematic pins               |\n    52\t| `pcbWidth` / `pcbHeight`  | `Distance`                                   | Override PCB footprint size                                 |\n    53\t| `schWidth` / `schHeight`  | `Distance`                                   | Override schematic box size                                 |\n    54\t| `pcbLayout` / `schLayout` | `LayoutConfig`                               | Advanced layout configuration                               |\n    55\t| `cellBorder` / `border`   | `Border \\| null`                             | Custom border styling                                       |\n    56\t| `schPadding*`             | `Distance`                                   | Schematic padding (`schPadding`, `schPaddingLeft`, etc.)    |\n    57\t| `pcbPadding*`             | `Distance`                                   | PCB padding (`pcbPadding`, `pcbPaddingLeft`, etc.)          |\n    58\t| `pcbPositionAnchor`       | `AutocompleteString<typeof ninePointAnchor>` | Anchor reference for `pcbX` / `pcbY` positioning            |\n    59\t\n    60\t---\n    61\t\n    62\t## Grid Layout Props\n    63\t\n    64\t### Example\n    65\t\n    66\t```tsx\n    67\texport default () => (\n    68\t  <board width=\"26mm\" height=\"20mm\">\n    69\t    <group pcbGrid pcbGridCols={2} pcbGridGap=\"1mm\">\n    70\t      <resistor name=\"R1\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n    71\t      <capacitor name=\"C1\" capacitance=\"10uF\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n    72\t      <led name=\"LED1\" color=\"red\" footprint=\"0603\" />\n    73\t      <chip name=\"U1\" footprint=\"soic8\" />\n    74\t    </group>\n    75\t  </board>\n    76\t)\n    77\t```\n    78\t\n    79\t### Grid Props Table\n    80\t\n    81\t| Prop                                                | Type               | Description              |\n    82\t| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------ |\n    83\t| `pcbGrid` / `schGrid`                               | `boolean`          | Enable grid layout       |\n    84\t| `pcbGridCols` / `schGridCols`                       | `number \\| string` | Number of grid columns   |\n    85\t| `pcbGridRows` / `schGridRows`                       | `number \\| string` | Number of grid rows      |\n    86\t| `pcbGridTemplateRows` / `schGridTemplateRows`       | `string`           | Explicit row template    |\n    87\t| `pcbGridTemplateColumns` / `schGridTemplateColumns` | `string`           | Explicit column template |\n    88\t| `pcbGridTemplate` / `schGridTemplate`               | `string`           | Shorthand grid template  |\n    89\t| `pcbGridGap` / `schGridGap`                         | `number \\| string` | Row & column gap         |\n    90\t| `pcbGridRowGap` / `schGridRowGap`                   | `number \\| string` | Row gap                  |\n    91\t| `pcbGridColumnGap` / `schGridColumnGap`             | `number \\| string` | Column gap               |\n    92\t\n    93\t---\n    94\t\n    95\t## Flex Layout Props\n    96\t\n    97\t### Example\n    98\t\n    99\t```tsx\n   100\texport default () => (\n   101\t  <board width=\"26mm\" height=\"20mm\">\n   102\t    <group\n   103\t      pcbFlex\n   104\t      pcbFlexGap=\"1mm\"\n   105\t      pcbAlignItems=\"center\"\n   106\t      pcbJustifyContent=\"space-between\"\n   107\t    >\n   108\t      <resistor name=\"R1\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n   109\t      <resistor name=\"R2\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n   110\t      <resistor name=\"R3\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n   111\t    </group>\n   112\t  </board>\n   113\t)\n   114\t```\n   115\t\n   116\t### Flex Props Table\n   117\t\n   118\t| Prop                                      | Type                                                                                               | Description                            |\n   119\t| ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n   120\t| `pcbFlex` / `schFlex`                     | `boolean \\| string`                                                                                | Enable flex layout                     |\n   121\t| `pcbFlexGap` / `schFlexGap`               | `number \\| string`                                                                                 | Gap between items                      |\n   122\t| `pcbFlexDirection` / `schFlexDirection`   | `\"row\" \\| \"column\"`                                                                                | Main axis direction                    |\n   123\t| `pcbAlignItems` / `schAlignItems`         | `\"start\" \\| \"center\" \\| \"end\" \\| \"stretch\"`                                                        | Cross-axis alignment                   |\n   124\t| `pcbJustifyContent` / `schJustifyContent` | `\"start\" \\| \"center\" \\| \"end\" \\| \"stretch\" \\| \"space-between\" \\| \"space-around\" \\| \"space-evenly\"` | Main-axis alignment                    |\n   125\t| `pcbFlexRow` / `schFlexRow`               | `boolean`                                                                                          | Force row direction                    |\n   126\t| `pcbFlexColumn` / `schFlexColumn`         | `boolean`                                                                                          | Force column direction                 |\n   127\t| `pcbGap` / `schGap`                       | `number \\| string`                                                                                 | Legacy alias for gap                   |\n   128\t| `pcbPack` / `schPack`                     | `boolean`                                                                                          | Enable packing utilities               |\n   129\t| `pcbPackGap`                              | `number \\| string`                                                                                 | Gap when packing                       |\n   130\t| `schMatchAdapt`                           | `boolean`                                                                                          | Match PCB adaptive sizing in schematic |\n   131\t\n   132\t---\n   133\t\n   134\t## Moving Multiple Components with `<group />`\n   135\t\n   136\t### Schematic Movement\n   137\t\n   138\t```tsx\n   139\t<group schX={5} schY={3}>\n   140\t  <resistor name=\"R1\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n   141\t  <resistor name=\"R2\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" schY={2} />\n   142\t  <resistor name=\"R3\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" schY={2} />\n   143\t</group>\n   144\t```\n   145\t\n   146\t### PCB Movement\n   147\t\n   148\t```tsx\n   149\t<group pcbX={5} pcbY={3}>\n   150\t  <resistor name=\"R1\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" />\n   151\t  <resistor name=\"R2\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" pcbY={2} />\n   152\t  <resistor name=\"R3\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" pcbY={2} />\n   153\t</group>\n   154\t```\n   155\t\n   156\t\n",
        "enable_truncation": true
      }
    ],
