        "text": "The file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tscircuit_operation_manual.md has been edited. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tscircuit_operation_manual.md:\n   268\t| [`<copperpour />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/copperpour.md) | Creates a copper pour (groundplane) connected to a specific net to improve signal integrity. |\n   269\t| [`<crystal />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/crystal.md) | Provides a stable clock signal essential for timing applications and microcontroller operations. |\n   270\t| [`<cutout />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/cutout.md) | Removes material from a board outline to add interior slots, mounting reliefs, or custom shapes. |\n   271\t| [`<diode />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/diode.md) | Semiconductor device that allows current to flow primarily in one direction. |\n   272\t| [`<footprint />`](./tsci_built_in_elements/footprint.md) | Defines PCB elements like plated holes or SMT pads for a component. |\n   273\t\n   274\tPlease refer to the individual markdown files for more details on each component.\n   275\t\n   276\t\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary.",
