        "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/skills/tsci_built_in_elements/mosfet.md:\n     1\t# <mosfet />\n     2\t\n     3\t## Overview\n     4\t\n     5\tA MOSFET (metal\u2013oxide\u2013semiconductor field-effect transistor) is a type of transistor used to control the flow of current in a circuit.\n     6\t\n     7\t### Basic Example\n     8\t\n     9\t```tsx\n    10\texport default () => (\n    11\t  <mosfet\n    12\t    name=\"Q1\"\n    13\t    channelType=\"n\"\n    14\t    mosfetMode=\"depletion\"\n    15\t    footprint=\"sot23\"\n    16\t  />\n    17\t)\n    18\t```\n    19\t\n    20\t### Previews\n    21\t\n    22\t![PCB Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pcb\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAy3KQQ5AMBAF0L1TTLpiJdiqG1hIXKDRaUhqptGRcHuldv%2B%2F%2F%2FEKfAhYdOb0AmUFeoCyAOh3jg4lJQAyO2o1Nepry2qI0M93SEjZ8nlkm8hi8Cgb%2F5NjlnBsJFpFlrZ7tR6K6gHwP0URegAAAA%3D%3D)\n    23\t![Schematic Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=schematic\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAy3KQQ5AMBAF0L1TTLpiJdiqG1hIXKDRaUhqptGRcHuldv%2B%2F%2F%2FEKfAhYdOb0AmUFeoCyAOh3jg4lJQAyO2o1Nepry2qI0M93SEjZ8nlkm8hi8Cgb%2F5NjlnBsJFpFlrZ7tR6K6gHwP0URegAAAA%3D%3D\\&simulation_experiment_id=simulation_experiment_0)\n    24\t![Pinout Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=pinout\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAy3KQQ5AMBAF0L1TTLpiJdiqG1hIXKDRaUhqptGRcHuldv%2B%2F%2F%2FEKfAhYdOb0AmUFeoCyAOh3jg4lJQAyO2o1Nepry2qI0M93SEjZ8nlkm8hi8Cgb%2F5NjlnBsJFpFlrZ7tR6K6gHwP0URegAAAA%3D%3D)\n    25\t![3D Circuit Preview](https://svg.tscircuit.com/?svg_type=3d\\&format=png\\&png_width=800\\&png_height=600\\&show_infinite_grid=true\\&background_color=%23ffffff\\&code=H4sIAJsBqGcAAy3KQQ5AMBAF0L1TTLpiJdiqG1hIXKDRaUhqptGRcHuldv%2B%2F%2F%2FEKfAhYdOb0AmUFeoCyAOh3jg4lJQAyO2o1Nepry2qI0M93SEjZ8nlkm8hi8Cgb%2F5NjlnBsJFpFlrZ7tR6K6gHwP0URegAAAA%3D%3D)\n    26\t\n    27\t---\n    28\t\n    29\t## Properties\n    30\t\n    31\t| Property      | Description                                                     | Example       |\n    32\t| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n    33\t| `channelType` | Type of MOSFET channel (`\"n\"` or `\"p\"`)                         | `\"n\"`         |\n    34\t| `mosfetMode`  | Operating mode of the MOSFET (`\"enhancement\"` or `\"depletion\"`) | `\"depletion\"` |\n    35\t\n    36\t\n",
        "enable_truncation": true
      }
    ],
