        "type": "text",
        "text": "The file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/circuit.tsx has been edited. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/circuit.tsx:\n    36\t    <A_150060GS75000 name=\"D1\" />\n    37\t    <resistor name=\"R121\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0603\" />\n    38\t\n    39\t    {/* Power Supply Nets */}\n    40\t    <net name=\"PWR\" />\n    41\t    <net name=\"GND\" />\n    42\t    <net name=\"AVDD\" />\n    43\t    <net name=\"CVDD\" />\n    44\t    <net name=\"DVDD\" />\n    45\t    <net name=\"TSREF\" />\n    46\t    <net name=\"LDOIN\" />\n    47\t    <net name=\"NEG5V\" />\n    48\t    <net name=\"PULLUP\" />\n    49\t\n    50\t    {/* NPN Supply Connections */}\n    51\t    <trace from=\".R4 > .pin1\" to=\"net.PWR\" />\n    52\t    <trace from=\".R4 > .pin2\" to=\".R3 > .pin1\" />\n    53\t    <trace from=\".R3 > .pin2\" to=\".Q1 > .pin3\" /> {/* Collector */}\n    54\t    <trace from=\".C1 > .pin1\" to=\".Q1 > .pin3\" />\n    55\t    <trace from=\".C1 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    56\t    <trace from=\".Q1 > .pin2\" to=\".U1 > .NPNB\" /> {/* Base */}\n    57\t    <trace from=\".Q1 > .pin1\" to=\"net.LDOIN\" /> {/* Emitter */}\n    58\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .LDOIN\" to=\"net.LDOIN\" />\n    59\t    <trace from=\".C59 > .pin1\" to=\"net.LDOIN\" />\n    60\t    <trace from=\".C59 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    61\t\n    62\t    {/* Main IC Power Connections */}\n    63\t    <trace from=\".R5 > .pin1\" to=\"net.PWR\" />\n    64\t    <trace from=\".R5 > .pin2\" to=\".U1 > .BAT\" />\n    65\t    <trace from=\".C5 > .pin1\" to=\".U1 > .BAT\" />\n    66\t    <trace from=\".C5 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    67\t\n    68\t    {/* Internal Regulators */}\n    69\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .AVDD\" to=\"net.AVDD\" />\n    70\t    <trace from=\".C6 > .pin1\" to=\"net.AVDD\" />\n    71\t    <trace from=\".C6 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    72\t\n    73\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .CVDD\" to=\"net.CVDD\" />\n    74\t    <trace from=\".C9 > .pin1\" to=\"net.CVDD\" />\n    75\t    <trace from=\".C9 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    76\t\n    77\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .DVDD\" to=\"net.DVDD\" />\n    78\t    <trace from=\".C7 > .pin1\" to=\"net.DVDD\" />\n    79\t    <trace from=\".C7 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    80\t    <trace from=\".C8 > .pin1\" to=\"net.DVDD\" />\n    81\t    <trace from=\".C8 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    82\t\n    83\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .NEG5V\" to=\"net.NEG5V\" />\n    84\t    <trace from=\".C3 > .pin1\" to=\"net.NEG5V\" />\n    85\t    <trace from=\".C3 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    86\t\n    87\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .TSREF\" to=\"net.TSREF\" />\n    88\t    <trace from=\".C2 > .pin1\" to=\"net.TSREF\" />\n    89\t    <trace from=\".C2 > .pin2\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    90\t\n    91\t    {/* Grounding */}\n    92\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .AVSS\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    93\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .CVSS\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    94\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .DVSS\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    95\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .REFHM\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    96\t    <trace from=\".U1 > .EP\" to=\"net.GND\" />\n    97\t  </board>\n    98\t)\n    99\t\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary.",
