".U1 > .VC16\" />\n   239\t\n   240\t    <net name=\"CB0\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB0\" to=\".U1 > .CB0\" />\n   241\t    <net name=\"CB1\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB1\" to=\".U1 > .CB1\" />\n   242\t    <net name=\"CB2\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB2\" to=\".U1 > .CB2\" />\n   243\t    <net name=\"CB3\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB3\" to=\".U1 > .CB3\" />\n   244\t    <net name=\"CB4\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB4\" to=\".U1 > .CB4\" />\n   245\t    <net name=\"CB5\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB5\" to=\".U1 > .CB5\" />\n   246\t    <net name=\"CB6\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB6\" to=\".U1 > .CB6\" />\n   247\t    <net name=\"CB7\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB7\" to=\".U1 > .CB7\" />\n   248\t    <net name=\"CB8\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB8\" to=\".U1 > .CB8\" />\n   249\t    <net name=\"CB9\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB9\" to=\".U1 > .CB9\" />\n   250\t    <net name=\"CB10\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB10\" to=\".U1 > .CB10\" />\n   251\t    <net name=\"CB11\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB11\" to=\".U1 > .CB11\" />\n   252\t    <net name=\"CB12\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB12\" to=\".U1 > .CB12\" />\n   253\t    <net name=\"CB13\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB13\" to=\".U1 > .CB13\" />\n   254\t    <net name=\"CB14\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB14\" to=\".U1 > .CB14\" />\n   255\t    <net name=\"CB15\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB15\" to=\".U1 > .CB15\" />\n   256\t    <net name=\"CB16\" /> <trace from=\"net.CB16\" to=\".U1 > .CB16\" />\n   257\t  </board>\n   258\t)\n   259\t\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary.",
        "enable_truncation": true
      }
    ],
